		{
			"id": "05276aa222383f2d",
			"type": "group",
			"label": "❓ Questions for you (2)",
			"x": 2760,
			"y": 400,
			"width": 380,
			"height": 310,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "6c6ace185012f82b",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "### 🎯 What was planned\nA Discord bot for my friends' server that turns what's in your fridge into a recipe idea.\n\n*Source of this: your plan, recorded on 2026-11-15*\n\n📋 [[Project Atlas/Pantry Chef/0 Plan|0 Plan]]",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 0,
			"width": 640,
			"height": 240,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "971e1aabe93deea5",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "### How close is it\nThe core idea works and grew sensibly: a cost guard and a Monday post were added. Favourites are half done, and the history has no backups or limits.",
			"x": 700,
			"y": 0,
			"width": 640,
			"height": 240
		},
		{
			"id": "4a9098d126fa0890",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "🔀 **Recipe from what's in the fridge**\n*built differently*\nThree recipes instead of one.\n\n→ [[Project Atlas/Pantry Chef/Parts/Recipe writer|Recipe writer]]",
			"x": 40,
			"y": 440,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 200
		},
		{
			"id": "09043032bc6837b5",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "✅ **Answer in the same channel**\n*built*\nIn a thread, which keeps the channel tidy.\n\n→ [[Project Atlas/Pantry Chef/Parts/Reply formatter|Reply formatter]]",
			"x": 40,
			"y": 670,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 200
		},
		{
			"id": "92d7900a8d4d7e42",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "🟡 **Save favourite recipes**\n*partly built*\nSaving works; listing them doesn't exist yet.\n\n→ [[Project Atlas/Pantry Chef/Parts/Favourites keeper|Favourites keeper]]",
			"x": 40,
			"y": 900,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 200
		},
		{
			"id": "804737d6625101ba",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "❌ **Vegetarian mode**\n*not built*",
			"x": 40,
			"y": 1130,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 100
		},
		{
			"id": "9c3c3dba104c7adf",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Recipes from ingredients**\nWorks end to end.\n\n→ [[Project Atlas/Pantry Chef/Parts/Recipe writer|Recipe writer]]",
			"x": 500,
			"y": 440,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 160
		},
		{
			"id": "1fab0318057051a9",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Cost guard**\nAdded after a friend sent 80 requests in one evening.\n\n→ [[Project Atlas/Pantry Chef/Parts/Cost guard|Cost guard]]",
			"x": 960,
			"y": 440,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 180
		},
		{
			"id": "7323586867c64fb3",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Monday stats**\nThe plan put statistics out of scope.\n\n→ [[Project Atlas/Pantry Chef/Parts/Weekly stats|Weekly stats]]",
			"x": 960,
			"y": 650,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 180
		},
		{
			"id": "cf51c76be78d0acb",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Listing favourites**\n\n→ [[Project Atlas/Pantry Chef/Parts/Favourites keeper|Favourites keeper]]",
			"x": 1420,
			"y": 440,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 120
		},
		{
			"id": "9336eabefe0726e7",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Vegetarian mode**\nPlanned as a nice-to-have; no trace in the code.",
			"x": 1880,
			"y": 440,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 140
		},
		{
			"id": "ccc1a9e1f17e3320",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**No backups of the history**\n\n→ [[Project Atlas/Pantry Chef/Storage/Request history|Request history]]",
			"x": 2340,
			"y": 440,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 120
		},
		{
			"id": "0fa3ad01198ae5d9",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Errors may log the API key**\n\n→ [[Project Atlas/Pantry Chef/Settings/API keys|API keys]] · [[Project Atlas/Pantry Chef/Parts/Recipe writer|Recipe writer]]",
			"x": 2340,
			"y": 590,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 120
		},
		{
			"id": "9c82558e0f908528",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Keep every request forever, or only for 90 days?**",
			"x": 2800,
			"y": 440,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 100
		},
		{
			"id": "5b6cc6da27daf153",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Is vegetarian mode still wanted?**",
